  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Control path",
      "items": [
        "Motor commands go out only when a full CRSF frame is decoded, so I2C traffic follows the RC frame rate",
        "300 ms without a frame → stop_all() once, LED blue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Startup",
      "items": [
        "naca_motor_init() loops forever if the driver board fails WHO_AM_I",
        "IMU gyro calibration takes about 7 s; without the IMU, headless and auto are disabled"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Worth checking",
      "items": [
        "D7 is on GPIO 0, marked as a test; the commented original is GPIO 10",
        "In SAFETY_MODE the lift gets 0 (or -100 while lowering), not LIFT_HOLD_SPEED as CLAUDE.md says"
      ]
    }
